                                        <div class="col-sm-12 border-btm">

                                            <h3><a href="https://www.psx.com.pk/psx/themes/psx/uploads/System-Audit-Panel-of-Auditor-LIST-Updated-as-of-April-22-2026.pdf" style="color:rgb(90, 186, 71);" target="_blank">Panel of Auditors –System Audit</a></h3>

<h3><a href="https://www.psx.com.pk/psx/themes/psx/uploads/Panel-of-Auditors-IBTS-Audit-09-07-25.pdf" target="_blank" style="color:rgb(90, 186, 71);">Panel of Auditors – IBTS Audit</a></h3>
